  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objectives for Pakistan: The Municipal Services Program focuses on basic municipal services that affect people&apos;s daily lives. In addition to infrastructure improvements, MSP works with local governments to develop urban planning policies and with community-based organizations to champion good hygiene practices.</narrative>
